{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/211458-request-dragonblood-custom-craft-charm-suggestions","id":211458,"title":"Request: Dragonblood Custom Craft Charm Suggestions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-28T11:10:45-07:00","id":211458,"title":"Request: Dragonblood Custom Craft Charm Suggestions","content":"Hello! While I'm most interested in Craft Charm suggestions, I'm interested in all Dragonblood custom charms that you think are good. What's the definition of good? Well, to me, it means that it's thematically appropriate, interesting, and actually contains some depth beyond, &quot;+2 dice in X situation!&quot; <br /> <br /> So, does anyone have any custom Dragonblood charms that they'd like to share?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1910-seconis","name":"Seconis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T12:28:09-07:00","id":211556,"title":"","content":"I never wrote it up, but I once had an idea for a charm based on Greater Unmaking where you could punch something into an amount of white jade equal to its local market value.<br /> <br /> <br /> (I didn't write it up because it inadvertently turned the game into Minecraft.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T19:20:29-07:00","id":211940,"title":"","content":"A trained slave is worth, what, Resources 4? That means you could punch someone into a talent of jade.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Yeah; something tells me this won't end well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T19:25:09-07:00","id":211944,"title":"","content":"Oh, that reminds me<br /> <br /> I also had an idea for a supplemental charm -- probably 1m or 2m -- that let you use Craft (Earth) or Craft (Fire) in place of any other elemental Craft skill, using the correct raw materials but the tools and methods appropriate to the ability you were substituting. Let's call it &quot;Cake-Forging Crucible&quot;.<br /> <br /> <br /> Yeah I only had dumb ideas. In my defense, dumb ideas kick ass.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T19:39:04-07:00","id":211954,"title":"","content":"Let's see what I put in my huge DB revision project I did a few years back! Note that I took from a lot of sources; not all these Charms were created by me. I just liked them. I will also keep it to brief explanations; if you want to see more just ask.<br /> <br /> <b>Strike the Anvil</b>: Divides crafting time by half, but can be used cooperatively to further divide the time.<br /> <br /> <b>Admirable Terrestrial Foreman</b>: Allows the previous to be used on large scale projects, overseeing a group of laborers.<br /> <br /> <b>(Element) Dragon Architecture</b>: Enhances a mundane craft with an elemental effect: Air stuff requires no maintenance. Earth stuff is immune to non-magical damage. Fire stuff grants a bonus die to use. Water stuff grants bonuses or imposes penalties when ingested by chosen people. Wood stuff is immune to environmental damage.<br /> <br /> <b>Saga of the Blade's Past Glories</b>: Used in response to any attack that would disarm or damage a weapon the DB wields, perfectly defending against it to negate the harm and leaving the weapon in the DB's hands. The weapon must be cherished, as with a positive Intimacy.<br /> <br /> <b>Enduring Design Qualities</b>: Makes an object or structure tougher.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> So, a couple of these are sorta rehashes of Solar Charms, given a twist to make them more Dragon-Blooded, but some I think are pretty cool on their own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T20:45:24-07:00","id":212011,"title":"","content":"There is a file called 10,000 Dragons, which is a complete remake of the Dragon-Blooded Charms. It's pretty good. I won't describe it as excellent, because I haven't played with it enough, but it might be. You should be able to find it easily. If not, pm me, and I'll figure out how to get it to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T23:10:47-07:00","id":212159,"title":"","content":"I kinda like that DB focus is not on artifact crafting. Errata'd Stone Carving Fingers Form lets them craft mundane items almost instantly depending on their speciality. That's pretty great! For more on that theme:<br /> <br /> <b>Dragonfire Foundry Method</b><br /> <b>Cost</b>: 1m; <b>Mins</b>: Craft 2, Essence 1; <b>Type:Simple</b><br /> <b>Keywords</b>: Combo-OK<br /> <b>Duration</b>: Indefinite<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms</b>: Terrestrial Craft Reinforcement<br /> <br /> When the Old Realm came crashing down, the Terrestrial Exalted were there to build lesser wonders from the ashes, aided by the toil of Creation's mortal populace.<br /> <br /> While active, this Charm improves the capability of its prerequisite to boost the Craft rating of anyone who is working on a Craft project under the Exalt's instructions. Applied to such targets, Terrestrial Craft Reinforcement treats all of them as if they were holding hands at the time of activation (regardless of actual location), ignores the usual cap of twice the beneficiary's Craft rating and has duration Indefinite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}